<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Approximate Rate for Car Transport from Trivandrum to Secunderabad
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the Approximate Rate For Car Transport From Trivandrum To Secunderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The rate is shaped by distance‑based mileage, the vehicle’s size and weight, fuel surcharge, GST on loading and unloading, insurance premium based on declared value, seasonal demand, and any extra services such as door‑to‑door pickup, custom crating, or expedited handling.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I book Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers for vehicle transport online?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Visit the company’s website, click the ‘Get Secunderabad Shifting Quote’ button, fill in pickup and drop‑off addresses, vehicle details, and preferred dates. You’ll receive an instant quote via email or SMS, and a representative can confirm the booking with a single click or a quick call.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my car fully insured during the transit from Trivandrum to Secunderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is 100% insured under an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy covering the full declared value of your vehicle. The insurance cost is transparently included in the final price, and any claim is processed swiftly with documented proof of loss, if any.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why does the transit time range between 4 and 6 days?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 4‑6 day window accounts for optimal routing on National Highway corridors, scheduled loading on multi‑axle express freight trucks, real‑time traffic monitoring, and mandatory driver rest periods. Weather variations or unforeseen roadwork may extend the timeline slightly, but the company strives to meet the lower end of the range.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden GST charges on loading and unloading for car shipping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden taxes are applied. The GST rate on loading and unloading of goods is clearly itemised in the transparent pricing breakdown. It follows the prevailing GST slab for logistics services, and the amount is shown upfront before you confirm the booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it’s being transported?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each carrier is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location updates to a secure portal. Customers receive a unique tracking link that shows the vehicle’s exact position, estimated arrival time, and any status changes, ensuring full visibility from pickup to delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures do the hydraulic ramp trailers provide to prevent scratches?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers feature enclosed, climate‑controlled containers, anti‑scratch rubberized ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. These elements secure the vehicle firmly, eliminate contact with road debris, and guarantee a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
